@CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@notePath = 01-dotnet-platform/01-dotnet-overview.md

### Health
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Liveness
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### Readiness
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### System info
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

### Get notes settings
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notes/settings
Accept: application/json

### Update notes settings
PUT {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notes/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "rootPath": "D:/Notes"
}

### List notes
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notes
Accept: application/json

### Read note content
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notes/content?path={{notePath}}
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{CodeCafe.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json
